        <headline>Small Craft Advisory issued September 24 at 2:34PM PDT until September 27 at 3:00AM PDT by NWS Eureka CA</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...Northwest winds 20 to 30 kt with gusts up to 35 kt and
seas 6 to 11 feet expected.

* WHERE...Waters from Pt. St. George to Cape Mendocino CA from
10 to 60 nm.

* WHEN...From 11 PM this evening to 3 AM PDT Sunday.

* IMPACTS...Conditions will be hazardous to small craft.
</description>
        <instruction>Inexperienced mariners, especially those operating smaller
vessels, should avoid navigating in hazardous conditions.</instruction>
